Third-party datasets
================================================================================

SRDD (Software Requirement Description Dataset)
  Source : ChatDev (OpenBMB)
           https://github.com/OpenBMB/ChatDev/tree/chatdev1.0/SRDD
  License: Apache License 2.0
  1,200 software-requirement descriptions across 40 application categories.
  Redistributed under srdd/data/.

SciCode
  Source : SciCode benchmark — "SciCode: A Research Coding Benchmark Curated by
           Scientists" (arXiv:2407.13168)
  License: Apache License 2.0
  80 scientific-computing problems. Problem data redistributed under scicode/data/.
  The ~1 GB numerical ground truth (test_data.h5) is NOT redistributed here;
  fetch it from the official release via scicode/eval/download_test_data.sh.
